{
  "name": "Atelier Senza Pari - Workflow 2 - Resposta Automatica com IA",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 2 - Resposta Automatica com IA\n\nGera uma resposta com Claude para e-mails em vendas@/contato@ e envia um RASCUNHO para o WhatsApp do Luciano aprovar antes de disparar.\n\nPor padrao o envio automatico fica DESLIGADO (node \"Envio Automatico Ativado?\").\nDepois de validar a qualidade das respostas por 2-3 semanas, mude o valor \"envioAutomatico\" para true no node \"Config\".\n\nfinanceiro@ NAO passa por este workflow (tratar manualmente).",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-260, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mailbox": "INBOX",
        "postProcessAction": "read",
        "format": "simple",
        "options": {
          "forceReconnect": 120
        }
      },
      "id": "imap-vendas",
      "name": "IMAP - vendas@",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-260, 260],
      "credentials": {
        "imap": {
          "name": "iCloud IMAP - vendas@ateliersenzapari.com.br"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mailbox": "INBOX",
        "postProcessAction": "read",
        "format": "simple",
        "options": {
          "forceReconnect": 120
        }
      },
      "id": "imap-contato",
      "name": "IMAP - contato@",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-260, 440],
      "credentials": {
        "imap": {
          "name": "iCloud IMAP - contato@ateliersenzapari.com.br"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "1", "name": "envioAutomatico", "type": "boolean", "value": false },
            { "id": "2", "name": "numeroWhatsappLuciano", "type": "string", "value": "5511999999999" },
            { "id": "3", "name": "whatsappPhoneNumberId", "type": "string", "value": "SEU_PHONE_NUMBER_ID_AQUI" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "config",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-260, 640]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\n\nreturn items.map((item) => {\n  const json = item.json;\n  const remetente = (json.from && json.from.value && json.from.value[0] && json.from.value[0].address) || json.from || '';\n  const remetenteNome = (json.from && json.from.value && json.from.value[0] && json.from.value[0].name) || '';\n  const assunto = json.subject || '';\n  const corpo = json.textPlain || json.text || '';\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      remetente,\n      remetenteNome,\n      assunto,\n      corpo\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "extrair",
      "name": "Extrair Dados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-40, 350]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
            { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: \"claude-sonnet-5\", max_tokens: 1024, system: \"Voce e o atendimento da Atelier Senza Pari, marca de acessorios de luxo para iPhone. Responda de forma cordial, objetiva, em portugues, mantendo o tom sofisticado da marca. Nao invente prazos, precos ou politicas que nao estejam no e-mail recebido; se nao souber algo, diga que um responsavel vai confirmar em breve.\", messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"E-mail recebido de \" + $json.remetenteNome + \" <\" + $json.remetente + \">.\\n\\nAssunto: \" + $json.assunto + \"\\n\\nMensagem:\\n\" + $json.corpo }] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "chamar-ia",
      "name": "Gerar Resposta (Claude)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [180, 350],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "Anthropic API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const resposta = $input.first().json;\nconst dados = $('Extrair Dados').first().json;\nconst config = $('Config').first().json;\n\nconst texto = (resposta.content && resposta.content[0] && resposta.content[0].text) || '';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...dados,\n    respostaIA: texto,\n    envioAutomatico: config.envioAutomatico,\n    numeroWhatsappLuciano: config.numeroWhatsappLuciano,\n    whatsappPhoneNumberId: config.whatsappPhoneNumberId\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "extrair-resposta",
      "name": "Extrair Texto da Resposta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [400, 350]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v19.0/{{ $json.whatsappPhoneNumberId }}/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ messaging_product: \"whatsapp\", to: $json.numeroWhatsappLuciano, type: \"text\", text: { body: \"Rascunho de resposta gerado por IA\\n\\nPara: \" + $json.remetenteNome + \" <\" + $json.remetente + \">\\nAssunto: \" + $json.assunto + \"\\n\\n--- Resposta sugerida ---\\n\" + $json.respostaIA + \"\\n\\n(Envio automatico esta \" + ($json.envioAutomatico ? \"LIGADO\" : \"DESLIGADO\") + \")\" } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "notificar-whatsapp",
      "name": "Enviar Rascunho para WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [620, 350],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "Meta Graph API - WhatsApp Business"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-envio",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.envioAutomatico }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "envio-ativado",
      "name": "Envio Automatico Ativado?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [840, 350]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Extrair Dados').first().json.remetente.includes('@vendas') ? 'vendas@ateliersenzapari.com.br' : 'contato@ateliersenzapari.com.br' }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.remetente }}",
        "subject": "=Re: {{ $json.assunto }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.respostaIA }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "enviar-resposta",
      "name": "Enviar Resposta por E-mail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1060, 260],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "name": "iCloud SMTP - contato@ateliersenzapari.com.br"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "aguardar-aprovacao",
      "name": "Aguardar Aprovacao Manual",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1060, 460]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "IMAP - vendas@": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Extrair Dados", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "IMAP - contato@": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Extrair Dados", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Extrair Dados": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Gerar Resposta (Claude)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Gerar Resposta (Claude)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Extrair Texto da Resposta", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Extrair Texto da Resposta": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Enviar Rascunho para WhatsApp", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Enviar Rascunho para WhatsApp": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Envio Automatico Ativado?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Envio Automatico Ativado?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Enviar Resposta por E-mail", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Aguardar Aprovacao Manual", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
